<title>UK: TENNIS-BELGIUM LEAD ROMANIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELGIUM LEAD ROMANIA IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium lead Romania 1-0 in their</p>
<p>Davis Cup World group qualifying tie after victory in the first</p>
<p>singles match on Friday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Johan van Herck beat Adrian Voinea 6-7 (6-8) 6-4 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>The second singles match between Andrei Pavel and Filip</p>
<p>Dewulf was postponed until Saturday because of rain.</p>
</text>
